<title>USA: Hayes Wheels gets contract for Opel Corsa.</title>
<headline>Hayes Wheels gets contract for Opel Corsa.</headline>
<dateline>ROMULUS, Mich. 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hayes Wheels International Inc said Thursday it was awarded a contract from Adam Opel Ag to supply cast aluminum wheels.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, Hayes will provide the wheels for Opel Corsa cars. Shipment is expected to start later this spring from the company's plant in Dello, Italy.</p>
<p>Opel is a wholly owned European unit of General Motors Corp.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
